          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Improved access to international payment and interbank clearing systems immediately reduces payment frictions and counterparty risk, enabling new cross‑border loans and equity transfers into hydrocarbon projects and reopening previously stalled financing lines." />
