          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in U.S. and partner influence/operational focus in the Iran corridor draws naval and air assets away from Europe (redeployments and demand for regional ISR), reducing forward readiness and deployment density available for the Russia–Ukraine theater." />
