          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising perception that the Ukraine conflict could spiral increases insurance premiums and risk-avoidance by commercial ship operators, causing vessels to reroute away from Middle Eastern chokepoints and reducing throughput through those sea lanes." />
