          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Intensifying geopolitical rivalry drives state actors and state‑backed investors to secure multi‑year supply contracts and equity stakes in foreign oil fields and infrastructure as strategic hedges, expanding the scope of long‑term access agreements." />
