          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in US–China strategic competition raises the probability of sanctions, supply‑chain shocks and sudden policy moves, prompting fast re-pricing across bonds, equities and FX and raising short-term market volatility." />
