          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharp increases in fixed‑income and FX volatility raise war‑risk and insurance premia and trigger risk‑averse ship operators and charterers to divert or delay sailings through high‑risk regional lanes, lowering commercial throughput." />
