          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher auction clearing yields increase sovereign borrowing costs and fiscal pressure, prompting authorities to seek upfront revenue and inward investment by accelerating or expanding long‑term access agreements, concessions, or asset‑sale arrangements with external parties." />
