          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher auction clearing yields raise immediate borrowing costs for sovereigns and state export‑credit agencies, shrinking budgetary headroom and the willingness to finance large or expedited arms procurements and export credits, slowing transfer tempo." />
